are only in the owner's Personal build and are not in this repository or in
the Public installer.


FFMPEG (Windows installer only)
-------------------------------
What it is: FFmpeg 9.0.2, a separate program for converting and filtering
audio and video. The "essentials" Windows build made by gyan.dev
(https://www.gyan.dev/ffmpeg/builds/).

Where it is: resources/ffmpeg/ffmpeg.exe in the installed app, with its own
licence (resources/ffmpeg/LICENSE.txt) and the builder's README
(resources/ffmpeg/README.txt), which lists the exact configuration and the
version of every library inside it.

How Video Forge uses it: as a separate program. Video Forge starts ffmpeg.exe
as its own process and passes it files and options; ffmpeg is not linked into
Video Forge and Video Forge is not part of ffmpeg. You may replace it with any
other ffmpeg build.

Licence: GNU General Public License, version 3 (the build includes GPL parts
such as x264, x265 and Rubber Band). See resources/ffmpeg/LICENSE.txt or
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html.

